WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.944 --> 00:00:19.209
Mandy, Vinnie, and Gildong stood outside the nobleman's house, listening.

2
00:00:19.229 --> 00:00:22.650
"Where is the music coming from?"

3
00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.190
wondered Mandy.

4
00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.591
She pointed toward a group of houses.

5
00:00:27.611 --> 00:00:30.992
"Maybe it's coming from over there."

6
00:00:32.612 --> 00:00:34.614
"No." Gildong shook his head.

7
00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.135
"It's coming from over there."

8
00:00:38.336 --> 00:00:41.018
Just then a girl raced toward them.

9
00:00:42.139 --> 00:00:45.101
She slammed into Gildong, knocking him down.

10
00:00:45.121 --> 00:00:49.123
"Oh!" cried the girl, falling too.

11
00:00:50.584 --> 00:00:52.906
Gildong stood and rubbed his arm.

12
00:00:52.926 --> 00:00:55.528
"Aren't you going to say sorry?"

13
00:00:55.848 --> 00:00:56.508
he snapped.

14
00:00:58.330 --> 00:00:58.970
"For what?"

15
00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.372
The girl dusted off her skirt.

16
00:01:02.456 --> 00:01:03.897
"You were in my way."

17
00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:06.999
Mandy stepped in between them.

18
00:01:07.019 --> 00:01:11.002
"My name is Mandy," she said to the girl.

19
00:01:11.022 --> 00:01:13.083
"What's yours?"

20
00:01:13.103 --> 00:01:20.788
"I'm uh well The girl's cheeks turned pink.

21
00:01:21.929 --> 00:01:24.611
"It's a secret," she said finally.

22
00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:28.734
At that Gildong finally smiled.

23
00:01:28.754 --> 00:01:32.076
"That's your name—'a secret'?"

24
00:01:32.372 --> 00:01:33.712
he said with a grin.

25
00:01:33.732 --> 00:01:36.553
"No!" said the girl.

26
00:01:37.593 --> 00:01:39.174
But she was smiling too.

27
00:01:39.194 --> 00:01:41.655
"What's that?"

28
00:01:42.215 --> 00:01:43.455
she asked suddenly.

29
00:01:44.475 --> 00:01:46.376
She could also hear music now.

30
00:01:46.396 --> 00:01:49.877
"I've never heard anything like that before."

31
00:01:49.897 --> 00:01:52.858
Gildong looked at her strangely.

32
00:01:52.878 --> 00:01:55.238
"Well, then let's go!"

33
00:01:55.718 --> 00:01:57.899
he said, running toward the sound.

34
00:01:59.339 --> 00:02:00.940
The others raced after him.

35
00:02:02.096 --> 00:02:03.817
"Look!" cried Mandy.

36
00:02:04.877 --> 00:02:09.519
A group of men were playing instruments and dancing in a large circle.

37
00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.200
The girl was amazed.

38
00:02:13.861 --> 00:02:15.522
"What is this?"

39
00:02:16.042 --> 00:02:16.602
she asked.

40
00:02:17.582 --> 00:02:18.543
"You don't know?"

41
00:02:18.943 --> 00:02:21.164
Gildong looked at her, surprised.

42
00:02:21.184 --> 00:02:23.545
"It's a peasant band!"

43
00:02:24.005 --> 00:02:24.545
he said.

44
00:02:24.565 --> 00:02:27.346
"They are celebrating the harvest."

45
00:02:27.366 --> 00:02:32.233
"Everyone is having so much fun," said Mandy.

46
00:02:32.253 --> 00:02:38.477
"Wow!" said Vinnie when one man began twirling wildly.

47
00:02:38.497 --> 00:02:40.579
"Look at that!"

48
00:02:41.699 --> 00:02:46.463
Some people danced to the beat while the crowd cheered for the performers.

49
00:02:47.844 --> 00:02:51.406
Mandy listened to a musician play a small horn.

50
00:02:51.426 --> 00:02:54.949
"Oh! He's really good!"

51
00:02:55.489 --> 00:02:56.049
she said.

52
00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:59.552
The girl watched with a huge smile.

53
00:03:00.596 --> 00:03:04.717
But when the band stopped playing, she stepped away from the crowd.

54
00:03:05.777 --> 00:03:07.938
There was an odd look on her face.

55
00:03:07.958 --> 00:03:10.299
"What's wrong?"

56
00:03:10.679 --> 00:03:11.599
Mandy asked her.

57
00:03:11.619 --> 00:03:15.420
"I think I’m lost the girl said.

58
00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:18.161
"My home is far from here."

59
00:03:19.261 --> 00:03:21.642
Then she looked nervously at Gildong.

60
00:03:21.662 --> 00:03:25.723
"Do you know how to get to the palace?"

61
00:03:26.903 --> 00:03:27.843
"The palace!"

62
00:03:28.224 --> 00:03:29.464
Gildong burst out.

63
00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.842
"Why do you need to go to the palace?"

64
00:03:34.043 --> 00:03:35.984
The girl stepped closer to them.

65
00:03:36.004 --> 00:03:38.526
"Can you keep a secret?"

66
00:03:39.067 --> 00:03:39.888
she whispered.

67
00:03:39.908 --> 00:03:43.010
"Yes," said Vinnie.

68
00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.972
"Of course!"

69
00:03:45.452 --> 00:03:46.353
answered Mandy.

70
00:03:46.373 --> 00:03:50.516
"The palace is my home," the girl said.

71
00:03:50.536 --> 00:03:52.818
"I am a princess."

72
00:03:54.019 --> 00:03:56.861
The children stared at the girl in surprise.

73
00:03:56.881 --> 00:04:00.304
"What?" cried Mandy.

74
00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.821
"You're a princess?"

75
00:04:03.941 --> 00:04:05.402
"What are you doing here?"

76
00:04:05.982 --> 00:04:06.863
asked Gildong.

77
00:04:06.883 --> 00:04:12.366
"I wanted to see the world outside the palace," the girl explained.

78
00:04:12.386 --> 00:04:16.668
"So I put on my servant's clothing and I escaped."
